      "content": "but it wasn't just a small mistake. it was something that really hurt people. i look in the mirror and i just see someone who is fundamentally broken. like, no matter how much i try to \"breathe\" or \"move on,\" the truth is still there. some people just aren't meant to be part of the world. they just cause damage and then they're done. i feel like everything i touch just gets ruined.",
